  <!-- ============ INTERACTIVE DEMO ============ -->
  <section class="demo-section" id="demo">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head-center">
        <h2>Experience for yourself</h2>
        <p>Experience Automatisor in action through this interactive demo</p>
      </div>
      <div class="storylane-embed">
        <script async src="https://js.storylane.io/js/v2/storylane.js" data-verify-origin=""></script>
        <div class="sl-embed" style="position:relative;padding-bottom:calc(68.71% + 25px);width:100%;height:0;transform:scale(1)">
          <iframe loading="lazy" class="sl-demo" src="https://app.storylane.io/demo/kxt8gykqezim?embed=inline" name="sl-embed" allow="fullscreen" allowfullscreen style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;border:1px solid rgba(63,95,172,0.35);box-shadow: 0px 0px 18px rgba(26, 19, 72, 0.15);border-radius:10px;box-sizing:border-box;"></iframe>
        </div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" inert style="display:none;visibility:hidden;width:1px;height:1px;">Automatisor is a sales pipeline tool for warehouse automation vendors. This demo covers three capabilities: identifying which warehouse facilities to prospect, evaluating fit against your ideal customer profile, and generating personalized outreach campaigns.

Automatisor researches warehousing facilities to surface buying signals related to operations, labor, inventory, infrastructure, customers, and financials. Signals include labor strain, broken processes, expansion plans, and operation closures. An "Ask Automatisor" chat interface lets users investigate any signal in depth. It functions as an on-demand account research assistant with knowledge of warehousing operations and the user's own products.

Each facility is scored for fit against the user's specific solution and Ideal Facility Profiles. Users can query why a given facility or Ideal Facility Profile segments received a particular fit rating. This scoring focuses prospecting activity on facilities that match defined target criteria.

For outreach, users configure campaign goals and messaging strategies at varying levels of personalization: account-level, department-level, title-level, or individual-level. Automatisor recommends relevant buying signals for each messaging variant. A single action generates a personalized outreach sequence based on the selected goals and messaging strategy. The resulting sequence can be deployed directly into email automation platforms via a one-click integration.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

